  "scope": "Native source build and 33 sanitized orchestration plus 24 explicit boot ordering/ownership cases with API peers. Derives exact originals, loads real libraries before Kernel-owned deferred class registration, and exposes explicit init/attach/start with failure cleanup. Requests original IOSurfaceRoot matching and rejects absent/inactive/wrong-class roots before entering the original unbounded wait; requires the original provider hierarchy. Unified boot prepares modules, holds real provider/root through synchronous board startup, then attaches display; all hardware attempts are one-shot. No module entrypoint or service has been invoked on a kernel; matching/termination races, physical power, actual parent lifecycle and runtime ABI remain unqualified."
